THERE IS A number called "Score" with value "0"
THERE IS A string called "Status" with value "Ready"

CONSTRAINT:
- "Score" cannot be greater than 100

WHEN Ignition:
  - OUTPUT "System Start..."
  - SET "Score" to "10" PLUS "40"
  - OUTPUT "Current Score:"
  - OUTPUT "Score"
  - IF "Score" IS "50":
      - OUTPUT "Score is perfect."
      - REPEAT 2 TIMES:
          - OUTPUT "Bonus Round!"
  - CREATE FILE "log.txt"
  - WRITE "System Success" TO FILE "log.txt"